    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d148">

                <pb facs="0242" n="134" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg134"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Rio
                                de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-02-19"><hi rendition="#italic">February 19, 1894</hi></date>.
                        (Received February 19.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Thompson announces the arrival on the preceding day of the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Nictheroy</hi>, which proceeded in a southerly direction
                    after landing several hundred men at the entrance of the harbor.</p>
            </div>
